{"id": "EUVD-2026-108646", "enisaUuid": "3a25e027-a988-3f91-8f01-f20f4519d7d4", "description": "`jwkFields.CheckConsistency` detected duplicate `key_ops` entries with a pairwise nested loop, making validation cost grow with the **square** of the entry count. Because the check runs on every JWK and JWKS unmarshal, a modestly sized but hostile JWKS document could occupy a CPU core for many seconds.", "datePublished": "2026-10-23T08:43:38", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-23T08:43:38", "baseScore": 6.9, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:N/VI:N/VA:L/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/eclipse-keypont/gose/security/advisories/GHSA-r56w-f43c-828p"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-89314"], "assigner": "eclipse", "epss": 0.0, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "840ed43b-7ebe-3fe8-bd64-0ff01309d2a0", "product": {"name": "Eclipse KeyPont - GOSE", "vendor": {"name": "Eclipse Foundation"}}, "product_version": "0 <1.0.0-rc4"}, {"id": "e8e38618-c209-3e27-a6df-09b29f4d992d", "product": {"name": "Eclipse KeyPont - GOSE", "vendor": {"name": "Eclipse Foundation"}}, "product_version": "0.7.3 \u22640.13.0-rc1"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "93fccc7f-6570-3335-8db6-12d33facb0cf", "vendor": {"name": "Eclipse Foundation"}}], "isExploited": false}